# EXEC and USR with machine code POKEd into RAM (our own suite only: the black-box lint refuses EXEC and USR)
# LDA #66 : STA 20100 : RTS at 20000; RTS at 20010 (USR1 gives back its argument)
10 POKE 20000,134:POKE 20001,66:POKE 20002,183
20 POKE 20003,78:POKE 20004,132:POKE 20005,57
30 EXEC 20000:PRINT PEEK(20100)
40 POKE 20100,0:EXEC:PRINT PEEK(20100)
50 POKE 20010,57:DEF USR1=20010:PRINT USR1(7.5)
60 PRINT USR(1)
RUN
